{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cardtographer is a stylized 3D graphic deck-builder in a roguelike style where you choose one or more champions to fight the evil that has taken over the land. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In an intense mix of deck-builder, RPG, and roguelike genres, your chosen champions collect gold and experience in battles with demons, monsters, and dragons, improving their decks and unlocking cards permantly, to finally defeat the opposing enemies ravaging the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/Untitled_000000-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1744267560\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 different champion classes all featuring their own deck, each having multiple playing styles and tactics to be discovered</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 180 cards which can be upgraded, crafted and bought after an initial unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose one or more champions, combining their advantages and\u00a0reduce their weaknesses</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also ally with your friends in online coop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 25 Map-Events with choices which can lead to positive or negative effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Original Music</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/extras/3dversion_Screenshot_2025.01.14_-_00.17.27.75.png?t=1744267560\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3460540?t=1744267560","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3460540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744267560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akama